Package: riskweave
Type: Package
Title: Multi-Objective Treatment Decision Frontier
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Iman", "Sadeghi", email = "i.sadeghi@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Renders treatment selection as a Pareto problem in efficacy x toxicity space, with confidence rings, modality-contribution decomposition, and evidence-perturbation sensitivity.
    Part of the glyphome suite of ten complementary visualization modules
    for advanced bioinformatics analysis and publication-grade figures.
